{"ref":"BDB, יְבוּס","hw":"יְבוּס","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">יְבוּס</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.loc. Jebus</strong>, name of Jerusalem according to <a data-ref=\"Judges 19:10\" href=\"/Judges.19.10\">Ju 19:10</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">יְבוּס הִיא יְרוּשָׁלַםִ</span>, cf. also v <a data-ref=\"Judges 19:11\" href=\"/Judges.19.11\">11</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:4\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.4\">1 Ch 11:4</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">יְרוּשָׁלַםִ הִיא יְבוּס</span>, cf. v <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:5\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.5\">5</a>.","next":"BDB, יְבוּסִי","prev":"BDB, בּוּס"}